" fill="#1d2943" font-size="11">Push-Pull drives both rails, so two of them must never share a net.</text><text x="10" y="312" fill="#64748b" font-size="11">Open-Drain only sinks. Rp sets the rise time and burns current while LOW - but wire-AND works.</text></svg></div>$vsq$)
